  { "Spell", "Call Fungarians", 281618, 37156, "Classless", "", "Summons 3 Fungarians to assault enemies for 30 sec, emitting a Cloud of Rot that suffocates nearby enemies.    Cannot be used while having an active pet.    This uses Force of Nature modifiers.      Cloud of Rot  Inflicts 98 Nature damage to nearby enemies every 2 sec for 30 sec.", "Epic", 187, nil, 0, false, 50, true },
