  { "Spell", "Dark Iron Land Mine", 282942, 37283, "Classless", "", "Places a Dark Iron Land Mine on the ground. The next hostile creature to pass near the mine causes it to explode. Mines are unstable and only last 30 sec.         Detonation  Deals 59 to 66 Fire damage to nearby enemies, and knocks them up.", "Rare", 187, nil, 0, false, 34, true },
