  { "Spell", "Shadowfall", 284650, 37522, "Classless", "Rank 1", "Unleash a flurry of dark stars from the sky, each impact deals 121 to 136 Shadow damage before exploding for an additional 22 Shadow damage to enemies within 5 yards. The effect lasts 8 sec, summoning up to 16 stars within 20 yards of you.    The final star grants you Shadow Trance .    This uses Starfall modifiers. Canceled if you shapeshift, lose character control, or mount.      Shadow Trance  Your next Shadow Bolt or Seed of Corruption is instant and costs 25% less mana.", "Legendary", 546, nil, 0, false, 60, true },
  { "Spell", "Frostfall", 284664, 37523, "Classless", "Rank 1", "Unleash a flurry of icy stars from the sky, each impact deals 121 to 136 Frost damage before exploding for an additional 22 Frost damage to enemies within 5 yards. The effect lasts 8 sec, summoning up to 16 stars within 20 yards of you.    The final star grants you Fingers of Frost .    This uses Starfall modifiers.    Canceled if you shapeshift, lose character control, or mount.      Fingers of Frost  Your spells and abilities treat the target as if it were Frozen. Holds 2 charges. Lasts for 15 seconds.", "Legendary", 546, nil, 0, false, 60, true },
