  { "Talent", "Cleansing Flames of the Apostate", 271210, 36461, "Classless", "", "Requires   Path of Healing  Casting Cauterizing Fire  or Pyroblast  grants you Flames of the Apostate  while in combat.  Dealing direct damage with Pyroblast  heals three nearby allies for 287.  Dealing periodic damage with Pyroblast  heals one nearby ally for 33.  Flamestrike  applies Cauterizing Embers  to allies standing within it.     Cauterizing Embers  Heals the target for 41 every 2 seconds.     Flames of the Apostate  Flamestrike 's cast time is reduced by 10% per stack.     At 10 stacks, Flamestrike  also grants a shield that absorbs 77 damage on up to 5 allies.", "Epic", 0, nil, 0, false, 16, true },
  { "Talent", "Legacy of the Arcanist", 271284, 36462, "Classless", "Fire", "Dealing direct damage with Arcane, Fire, Frost, and Nature empowers your next Meteor cast with its own element.  Casting Meteor unleashes the stored elements, causing 615 damage to the target and up to 2 additional targets.   When casting spells involving multiple elements, only the Meteor corresponding to the first element in the order of Fire, Nature, Frost, and Arcane will trigger.", "Legendary", 0, nil, 0, false, 36, true },
  { "Talent", "Cryotherapist", 271313, 36463, "Classless", "", "Requires   Path of Healing   Dealing damage with Frostbolt , Frostfire Bolt , or Ice Lance  triggers a heal on a nearby ally for 223.    Dealing damage with Deep Freeze  triggers a heal on 5 nearby allies for 297 and applies Cryotherapy  to them.    Dealing damage with Icy Penance  triggers a heal on 3 nearby allies for 224.    Heals from Cryotherapist  benefit from healing modifiers and can trigger additional effects.    Ranks 1-3 of Frostbolt trigger a lesser version of the heal.        Cryotherapy  Restore 60 each 2 second for 10 sec", "Legendary", 0, nil, 0, false, 10, true },
  { "Talent", "Fingers of Light", 271317, 36465, "Classless", "", "Your direct Holy heals now grant you Fingers of Light .      Fingers of Light  Increases your chance to proc Fingers of Frost by 10%. Stacks up to 5 times and lasts 1 min or until it triggers.", "Epic", 0, nil, 0, false, 20, true },
