  { "Talent", "Spirit Frost", 271323, 36467, "Classless", "", "Requires   Path of Healing   Every other cast of Frostbolt, Frostfire Bolt or Ice Lance grants you Spirit Frost .         Spirit Frost  Greater Heal reduces its cast time by 100% and Prayer of Healing reduces its cast time by 50%.     Can hold up to 5 charges and lasts 20 sec.", "Legendary", 0, nil, 0, false, 10, true },
