  { "Talent", "Harvest Essence", 275962, 36830, "Classless", "", "Shadow spells with a cast time grant Harvested Essence .      Harvested Essence  Next Drain Life or Drain Soul channels 10% faster and hits 10% faster. Stacks up to 5. Lasts 10 sec.    Reduces the heal onto the caster from the life leeched with Drain Life by 80%.", "Legendary", 0, nil, 0, false, 10, true },
