  { "Talent", "Elemental Lord", 276578, 36891, "Classless", "", "Your Elemental Blast and Lava Burst empower you at random with Elemental Earth , Elemental Frost  or Elemental Fire .  The selected shock spell deals 50% increased direct damage.      Elemental Earth  Earth Shock triggers aftershocks, dealing additional damage to 3 nearby targets over 3 seconds.     Elemental Frost  Frost Shock causes your next Lava Burst to solidify, dealing 55% more damage.     Elemental Fire  Empowers your next Flame Shock direct damage to have a 100% chance and its periodic damage to have a 20% chance to reset the cooldown of Lava Burst.", "Legendary", 0, nil, 0, false, 22, true },
  { "Talent", "Tethered Power", 276583, 36892, "Classless", "", "Your Tethered Elemental's critical strikes now grant you Elemental Air .      Elemental Air  Your next Elemental Blast has its critical strike chance, critical strike damage bonus, and damage against monsters increased by 30%.", "Legendary", 0, nil, 0, false, 10, true },
